<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia end-March foreign reserves 1.71 bln dinars.</title>
<headline>Tunisia end-March foreign reserves 1.71 bln dinars.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's total foreign exchange reserves were 1.713 billion dinars at end of March 1997, up from 1.236 billion dinars at end of March 1996, Central Bank figures showed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>TUNISIA RESERVES</p>
<p>		    March31/97  Feb28/97    Dec 31/96   March/96</p>
<p>    Foreign     1,669	 1,831	 1,892	 1,204</p>
<p>    Gold		4	     4	     4	     5</p>
<p>    SDRs	     40	    25	    21	    27</p>
<p>Note - Figures in millions of dinars and subject to rounding.  ($=1.09 dinar)</p>
<p>Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
